00:02:15.760 --> 00:02:18.060
typically four growth and four defensive.

00:02:18.700 --> 00:02:22.720
You then rebalance quarterly using a simple moving average filter

00:02:22.720 --> 00:02:23.660
on each sleeve.

00:02:24.340 --> 00:02:27.640
Historical data shows the structure delivered lower volatility

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.780
than pure equity benchmarks during 2022's rate hike cycle

00:02:32.400 --> 00:02:34.800
while still participating in the subsequent recovery.

00:02:35.520 --> 00:02:38.400
The main risk is over concentration in the growth leg

00:02:38.400 --> 00:02:40.180
if sector rotation stalls.

00:02:40.840 --> 00:02:44.680
So position sizing should respect a 5% single name cap

00:02:44.680 --> 00:02:46.320
inside the TFSA.

00:02:47.320 --> 00:02:49.760
